","due_on":"2026-10-24T00:00:00Z","closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-30T04:53:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:55:53Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T04:55:51Z","assignee":{"login":"elalfner","id":26582028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTgyMDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26582028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner","html_url":"https://github.com/elalfner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\nShow a short message under the counter when its value is exactly forty-two, so the person using the app gets a small celebration at that number.\n\n## Outcome\n\nWhen the counter reaches 42 the text \"Forty-two!\" appears under it, and it disappears as soon as the value changes.\n\n## Scenarios\n\n- **WHEN** the counter shows 42\n- **THEN** the text \"Forty-two!\" is visible under the counter\n\n- **WHEN** the counter shows any value other than 42\n- **THEN** no \"Forty-two!\" text is visible\n\n## Edge cases\n\n- Counter goes from 42 to 43: the message disappears.\n- Counter starts at 0: no message.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Messages for other numbers.\n- Any change to the increment button.\n\n## Decisions\n\n### D1. Plain text below the counter\nDecided: the message is a plain `Text` widget placed below the counter value.\nWhy: smallest change, easy to test.\nDiscarded: a snackbar (it hides on its own and is harder to assert).\n\n## Constraints\n\n- C1: No new dependencies.\n\n## Code pointers\n\n- `lib/main.dart`: holds the counter screen and its state.\n\n## Verification\n\n- On a device, tap the button 42 times and see \"Forty-two!\" appear, then tap once more and see it disappear.\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- The text is in English only.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/66/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/66/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/63","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/63/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/63/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/63/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elalfner/relevo-sandbox/issues/63","id":6113223944,"node_id":"I_kwDOVJsv4c8AAAABbGBlCA","number":63,"title":"Show a message when the counter is thirty-one","user":{"login":"elalfner","id":26582028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTgyMDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26582028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner","html_url":"https://github.com/elalfner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elalfner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: